      "filename": "Gulf of Venezuela (MODIS 2016-02-04).jpg",
      "title": "File:Gulf of Venezuela (MODIS 2016-02-04).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b5/Gulf_of_Venezuela_%28MODIS_2016-02-04%29.jpg",
